---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { lineUrl } from '../data/navigation';

const title = 'THC Gummies in Thailand — What to Know | Baked Brand';
const description =
  "Thinking about THC gummies in Thailand? What to know about regulation and quality, plus why Baked's FDA-approved cookies are more reliably regulated.";

const structuredData = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://bakedthailand.com/' },
    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'THC Gummies in Thailand', item: 'https://bakedthailand.com/thc-gummies-thailand/' },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="bk-article-hero">
    <p class="bk-eyebrow">Before You Buy</p>
    <h1>THC Gummies in Thailand — What to Know Before You Buy</h1>
    <p class="bk-sub">
      Baked does not currently make gummies, but here is what to know if you are considering them, and what we offer instead.
    </p>
  </section>

  <article class="bk-article-body">
    <section>
      <h2>What are THC gummies?</h2>
      <p>
        THC gummies are cannabis-infused chewable candies, similar in format to regular gummy candy but dosed with THC. Quality and regulation vary enormously across brands, particularly in Thailand where the edibles market is still maturing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Are THC gummies available in Thailand?</h2>
      <p>
        Yes, THC gummies are sold at some dispensaries and online in Thailand. However, most are unregulated products with no Thai FDA approval, meaning the dosage, ingredients, and safety standards are not independently verified.
      </p>
      <p>
        Unlike cookies and caramels, gummies are not currently included in the Thai FDA's approved edible formats for THC microdose products. This means any THC gummy you find is operating in a grey zone of the regulations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Why Baked does not make gummies</h2>
      <p>
        Baked Brand chose to focus on Thai FDA-approved formats: cookies and caramels. The Thai FDA approval process ensures each product meets strict standards for THC content (up to 1.6mg per piece), ingredient sourcing, and labeling.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our cannabis is sourced as full-spectrum fan leaf infusions from a sativa-dominant hybrid plant developed by Maejo University, one of Thailand's leading agricultural institutions. This is not an extract or isolate. It is a whole-plant infusion giving a smoother, more natural effect.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What Baked offers instead</h2>
      <p>
        If you are looking for a reliable, legal, and precisely dosed THC edible in Thailand, Baked Brand products are your best option:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cannabis Cookies</strong> — 1.6mg THC per cookie, Thai FDA approved</li>
        <li><strong>Cannabis Caramels</strong> — 1mg THC per piece, Thai FDA approved</li>
        <li><strong>Coconut Caramels</strong> — 1mg THC per piece, Thai FDA approved</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        All products are made in a licensed Thai facility, clearly labeled with THC content, and legal for adults aged 20 and over.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How to order</h2>
      <p>
        Order directly through LINE for delivery across Thailand, including Bangkok, Chiang Mai, Phuket, Pattaya, Koh Samui, and more.
      </p>
      <div class="bk-cta-row">
        <a class="bk-cta-primary" href={lineUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Order on LINE</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
